# Winterspring - Rares & Treasures companion (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# An opportunistic sweep for the 7 rares and the fixed Solid Chests of
# Winterspring. Run it in its own Polestar tab at the end of the core route
# or standalone. EVERY goal is optional: a rare that is not up never holds
# the route. Spawn points and levels are the local Forever game data
# (questie-forever); signature drops are items whose SOLE dropper anywhere in
# the data is the rare. Ordinary goods and generic multi-zone world drops get
# a note, not a goal. Mezzir the Howler and Rak'shiri are beast-shaped but
# carry no tame line: the data has no tameability flag and no contract quest
# kills wolves or cats to corroborate, so both tame questions are logged in
# docs/companion-unverified.md. Respawn timers are unconfirmed anywhere, so
# none are stated. Core-quest and quest-start objects live in the core guide -
# see docs/winterspring-companions-inventory.md for the full inventory. This
# guide never accepts or turns in.
guide butler-routes-completionist/winterspring-rares
title Winterspring - Rares & Treasures
levels 47-60
zone Winterspring
faction Alliance
category Collectibles
folder Companions
keywords winterspring, rares, treasures, companions
coords live
version 1

step General Colbatann - south of Mazthoril

  zone map 1452

  loop
  goto 54.20,50.29
  goto 55.34,49.81
  goto 59.67,49.52
  kill 10196 optional
  note Level 57 rare elite south of Mazthoril; no sole drop in the data, so there is nothing signature to chase.
  note Also drops ordinary goods and generic world greens; respawn timer unconfirmed.

step Mezzir the Howler - east of the Winterfall village

  zone map 1452

  goto 45.03,37.37
  kill 10197 optional
  note Level 55 rare east of the Winterfall village; no sole drop in the data, so there is nothing signature to chase.
  note Also drops ordinary goods and generic world greens; respawn timer unconfirmed. The tame question (wolf) is logged in docs/companion-unverified.md.

step Kashoch the Reaver - the far south

  zone map 1452

  goto 63.36,70.19
  kill 10198 optional
  note Level 60 rare elite in the far south, at the top of the band; no sole drop in the data, so there is nothing signature to chase.
  note Also drops ordinary goods and generic world greens; respawn timer unconfirmed.

step Grizzle Snowpaw - the eastern furbolgs

  zone map 1452

  goto 66.90,35.60
  kill 10199 optional
  collect 284268 "Furbolg Shaman's Girdle" optional
  note Level 59 rare with the eastern furbolgs; the Girdle comes only from Grizzle anywhere in the data.
  note Also drops ordinary goods and generic world greens; respawn timer unconfirmed.

step Rak'shiri - the northern edge

  zone map 1452

  goto 51.13,10.81
  kill 10200 optional
  note Level 57 rare on the northern edge; no sole drop in the data, so there is nothing signature to chase.
  note Also drops ordinary goods and generic world greens; respawn timer unconfirmed. The tame question (cat) is logged in docs/companion-unverified.md.

step Lady Hederine - the deep south (come back later)

  zone map 1452

  goto 65.03,80.28
  kill 10201 optional
  note Level 61 rare elite in the deep south, one level above the band: bank it and come back at 61; no sole drop in the data, so there is nothing signature to chase.
  note Also drops ordinary goods and generic world greens; respawn timer unconfirmed.

step Azurous - southeast of the Altar

  zone map 1452

  goto 66.74,53.81
  kill 10202 optional
  collect 284261 "Magically Fortified Legguards" optional
  note Level 59 rare elite southeast of the Altar of Elune; the Legguards come only from Azurous anywhere in the data.
  note Also drops ordinary goods and generic world greens; respawn timer unconfirmed.

step Solid Chests - fixed placements

  zone map 1452

  loop
  goto 29.27,46.90
  goto 30.50,35.71
  goto 33.09,36.69
  goto 39.66,43.13
  goto 41.51,42.52
  goto 46.02,35.97
  goto 53.02,40.48
  goto 55.84,44.69
  goto 66.36,35.89
  goto 66.64,37.06
  goto 67.63,35.28
  goto 68.08,36.70
  goto 71.30,81.90
  interact 153454 optional
  interact 153453 optional
  note The zone's generic chests: Solid Chests at fixed placements (two chest objects sharing the name, thirteen points between them). Loot is level-appropriate coin and goods; respawn timer unconfirmed.
